Looking at the current program, the main issues are:
1. The DE loop is extremely slow (1 eval per iteration, O(n²) non-dominated sort every 20 steps)
2. The selection strategy only replaces the target, missing many good solutions
3. No exploitation phase - the algorithm doesn't refine promising regions

I'll keep the Sobol initialization but replace the slow DE with a faster batch-based approach and add a final local refinement phase.

